B.bRC=s(["Subcostal position, right tilt","Identify ductus venosus (DV) \u2014 enters IVC from below","Colour Doppler helps identify DV flow","Watch for subtle back-and-forth movement of catheter tip during insertion","UVC should enter IVC via DV \u2014 not directly","Tip should be at junction of IVC and right atrium, not in RA","Reduce sample gate width to 1 mm","Use moderate Doppler colour scale","Angle correction may be required due to acute caudal turn of both vessels"],t.s)
